<title>USA: Earle M. Jorgensen Co Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Earle M. Jorgensen Co Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BREA, Calif. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiscal 1997     Fiscal 1996</p>
<p>Nine Months Ended Dec. 31, 1996:</p>
<p> Revenues				$756,100,000    $764,000,000</p>
<p> Operating income			29,500,000  33,400,000 (a)</p>
<p> Loss before taxes		    (1,000,000)    (10,200,000)</p>
<p> Net loss				 (1,200,000)     (8,600,000)</p>
<p>Third Quarter Ended Dec. 31, 1996:</p>
<p> Revenues				 250,700,000     254,700,000</p>
<p> Operating income			 6,000,000	13,300,000</p>
<p> Income (loss) before taxes	 (4,700,000)	 2,600,000</p>
<p> Net loss				 (4,800,000)	 (500,000)</p>
<p>(a) Operating income for fiscal 1996 excludes a one-time restructuring charge for workforce realignment and asset write-downs totaling $12,800,000.</p>
</text>
